## 5. 数据库初始化

### 5.1 创建数据库

```sql
CREATE DATABASE pharmacy_db CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;
```

### 5.2 执行初始化脚本

```bash
# 进入MySQL
mysql -u root -p

# 执行脚本
USE pharmacy_db;
SOURCE /path/to/init_mysql.sql;
SOURCE /path/to/seed_data.sql;
```

### 5.3 数据库配置

修改 `backend/src/main/resources/application.yml`:

```yaml
spring:
  datasource:
    url: jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/pharmacy_db?useUnicode=true&characterEncoding=utf8&serverTimezone=Asia/Shanghai
    username: root
    password: 123456
```

